{"sourceUrl":"https://rwskxb.hit.edu.cn/2025/0720/c20438a374400/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.442818+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rwskxb.hit.edu.cn/2025/0720/c20438a374400/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>诚</span><span><span>挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我部攻读硕士学位研究生（</span><span>2年制）。为便于推免生申请，特制定本通知，具体安排如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span>1、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>在满足我校接收推免生的相关要求基础上，</span><span>要求推免生本科毕业专业与</span><span>人文社科学部</span><span>的接收学科相同或相近</span><span>。</span><span>允许学生在相近学科内跨学科攻读硕士学位</span><span>，</span><span>跨学科推免生参加接收学科的复试，由接收学科确定是否接收。</span></p><p><strong><span>2、审核流程</span></strong></p><p><span>1）审核时间：申请人在完成信息采集后，学科将定期审核（</span><strong><span><span>报名截止时间：</span><span>2025年9月10日</span></span></strong><span>）。</span></p><p><span>2）通知形式：通过信息采集系统或邮箱（hitsis205@163.com）通知学生审核通过情况。</span></p><p><strong><span>3、面试安排</span></strong></p><p><span>1）面试时间、地点（以通知为准）</span></p><p><span>2）面试所需携带材料按学校要求。</span></p><p><strong><span>4、联系方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>学科</span></p></td><td><p><span>邮箱</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>社会学、社会工作</span></p></td><td><p><span>190506457@qq.com</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>应用经济学</span></p></td><td><p><span>13936241018@qq.com</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>外国语言文学、翻译</span></p></td><td><p><span>liyingxu_hit</span><span>@1</span><span>26</span><span>.com</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>学部联系人：丁老师      </span><span>邮箱：</span><span>hitsis205@163.com</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>其他未尽事宜按学校相关文件及规定执行。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>                   哈尔滨工业大学人文社科学部</span></p><p><span>2025年7月20日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e99baefd703ffb2d2f66d6e81c6e63da6c17b5b58099163f74d240014e8850fd","textLength":465,"sourceSha256":"5ca39b163304cdea9c4ae0b279c19528668f0162f3c1a88f69f7e5d73b656a56","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMed